                                "sense_id": "2f697a07-5968-32f8-8ca1-61127d1dab56",
                                "text": "The family Canidae^([sic]) consists of two main subgroups, the vulpines (foxes) and the canines (wolves, coyotes, jackals, and dogs), and some intermediate “fox-dog” forms from South America."
                            }
